<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>About Us | <%= settings.school_name %></title>
  <%- include('partials/theme-init') %>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css" />
</head>
<body class="public-page">
  <%- include('partials/public-nav', { active: 'about' }) %>
  <main class="public-info">
    <p class="eyebrow">About Us</p>
    <h1>A connected school community starts here.</h1>
    <p class="public-lead">The Secondary School Student Information Management System brings the essential tools of school administration together in one clear, accessible place.</p>
    <section class="public-info-card">
      <h2>Supporting every role</h2>
      <p>Administrators can coordinate school records and operations. Teachers can manage classroom information and assessments. Students and parents can access relevant profiles, attendance, results, and announcements through their own role-based accounts.</p>
      <a class="primary-btn" href="/login">Sign In to your account</a>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer class="public-footer"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/contact">Contact Us</a></footer>
  <script src="/js/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
